Package: CohortBuilder
Title: Bootstrap SQL-Based Matched Study Cohort Builder
Version: 0.1.2.1
Authors@R:
    c(
    person("Sebastian", "Mildiner Moraga",
           email = "s.mildinermoraga@umcutrecht.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "")),
    person("Wijnand", "Laan", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Constructs matched study cohorts by matching eligible exposed
    individuals to eligible controls based on predefined profile variables and
    time windows. Matching is executed in DuckDB using SQL and optionally
    repeated via bootstrap resampling. Supports both matching with replacement
    (with optional bootstrap) and greedy matching without replacement.
